  "description": "DISPLAY New display with NFC card activation for more secure startup and greater protection against theft. Three-button controller for simple and intuitive management of all functions. MOTOR The slightly upgraded rear hub motor develops 250W of power and 50 Nm of torque in a weight of just over 3 kg. Compact and versatile, it requires no special routine maintenance. DRUMS The enhanced 630 Wh battery is installed and seamlessly integrated into the downtube. It can be recharged via the charging port both when mounted on the bike and when removed from the frame. Range up to 100 km in optimal route/rider conditions.\n\nBE GREEN TECHNOLOGIES The 27.5″ HPG aluminum frame with a fully integrated battery is paired with the integrated hub motor, which, with its 50Nm, provides ideal assistance for tackling urban routes and light gravel paths. The standard equipment with fenders, a rear rack, and lights makes it comfortable and versatile for use in various path conditions. IDEAL FOR It is the pedal-assisted trekking bike ideal for urban and extra-urban routes, for daily commutes and for trips out of town on light dirt roads. PERFECT FOR YOU IF If you are looking for a comfortable, reliable and versatile e-bike for your daily city commutes and for your short to medium-range Sunday rides.",
